            "review_title": "Review at Cua Ngon Binh Duong",
            "review_text": "An Nguyen\n2 contributions\n0\nVisit Cua Ngon's Restaurant\nDec 2019 • Friends\nCua Ngon's Restaurant is so delicious!\nCrab meat's so yummy and its price's very good.I recommeded dishes is Crab Roasted Tamarind,Crab Roasted Thai's Curry,Crab Roasted Black Peper,specially Crab Hotpot in here. Đặc biệt lẩu Riêu Cua. My friends and me pay cash only 1.200.000 VNĐ so cheap but eat well.Thump up👍👍👍👍👍\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 24, 2019",
